1
00:00:00,752 --> 00:00:03,222
(Raj:)Hey, did I say
something to upset you?

2
00:00:03,221 --> 00:00:04,651
(Howard:)No, I'm fine.

3
00:00:04,656 --> 00:00:06,486
(Raj:)Really? Because usually
we walk side by side,

4
00:00:06,491 --> 00:00:08,521
(Raj:)and I just went up
two flights of stairs

5
00:00:08,527 --> 00:00:11,497
(Raj:)staring at your bottom.

6
00:00:11,496 --> 00:00:13,626
(Howard:)Just drop it.

7
00:00:13,632 --> 00:00:15,902
(Raj:)Okay, I think I see
what's happening here.

8
00:00:15,901 --> 00:00:17,171
(Raj:)You're jealous of me.

9
00:00:17,169 --> 00:00:18,399
(Howard:)Oh, please.

10
00:00:18,403 --> 00:00:20,933
(Howard:)What could you possibly have
that I would be jealous of?

11
00:00:20,939 --> 00:00:24,679
(Raj:)It's not what I have, it's how
many people I'm having it with.

12
00:00:26,411 --> 00:00:28,341
(Penny:)Come on, Sheldon, we'll watch
Game of Thrones over here.

13
00:00:28,347 --> 00:00:30,147
- Gladly.
LEONARD: - Oh, good, go.

14
00:00:30,148 --> 00:00:31,248
(Leonard:)You know, it'll be nice

15
00:00:31,249 --> 00:00:33,019
(Leonard:)to watch an episode
without someone saying,

16
00:00:33,018 --> 00:00:34,188
"I read the books.

17
00:00:34,186 --> 00:00:36,816
(Leonard:)Don't get too fond
of this character."

18
00:00:36,822 --> 00:00:39,052
(Sheldon:)It's not always
because they die.

19
00:00:39,057 --> 00:00:40,987
(Sheldon:)In one case, it's because
they've become involved

20
00:00:40,993 --> 00:00:42,893
(Sheldon:)with underground tree people
from the dawn of time.

21
00:00:42,894 --> 00:00:44,624
(Sheldon:)Yeah, but I won't
say who it is.

22
00:00:44,629 --> 00:00:45,759
It's Bran!

23
00:00:47,165 --> 00:00:49,135
(Howard:)Wait, what is going on?

24
00:00:49,134 --> 00:00:51,134
(Penny:)Leonard's being a jerk,
so we're gonna watch over here,

25
00:00:51,136 --> 00:00:52,666
(Amy:)Do you guys want
to watch with us?

26
00:00:52,671 --> 00:00:54,271
(Howard:)As long as I don't
have to watch with him.

27
00:00:54,272 --> 00:00:55,902
(Raj:)Fine, I don't want to
watch with you either.

28
00:00:55,907 --> 00:00:56,877
(Raj:)I'll go over here.

29
00:00:56,875 --> 00:00:58,145
(Howard:)Why do you get to pick?

30
00:00:58,143 --> 00:00:59,273
Okay, then you go there!

31
00:00:59,277 --> 00:01:01,647
Don't tell me where to go!

